    of sources could not be read"). New lib/sg-apt-sources: "heal" gives
    each repository one keyring and turns the repeat off (malformed
    third-party lines too), backs the files up to
    /var/backups/sg-apt-sources and logs every change; sg-update-prepare
    runs it before refreshing. "adopt" lets SG Store reuse a repository that
    is already configured instead of adding a second entry.
