    keeping them current); a detection is moved to a root-only quarantine
    and the person is told. On by default; /etc/stained-glass/defender.conf
    enabled=0 (Settings > Virus & threat protection) turns it off.
    Depends on clamav-daemon, clamav-freshclam and clamdscan. Starts clamd
    itself when it is not running (the package skips it at install, before
    freshclam has the first definitions). QA VM: a real ClamAV quarantined
