sg-session (0.1.0-63) unstable; urgency=medium

  * sg-pdf is SG PDF's editor engine: MuPDF (python3-pymupdf, AGPL) in
    place of poppler, with pdf/sgpdf.py (installed in
    /usr/lib/stained-glass/pdf) behind the same bridge and viewer protocol.
    New requests edit text in place (the block's glyphs removed, the new
    text reflowed in its width in the matched font), add, move, resize,
    replace and delete pictures and paths; add, move, edit and delete
    standard comments (highlight, underline, strikeout, note, free text,
    shapes, ink); fill AcroForm fields, flatten, place signatures; mark,
    find (phrases and patterns) and apply true redactions -- text, image
    pixels and vector paths removed from the content streams, touched
    rectangles and rules drawn again around the marks, saving a full
    rewrite -- and remove hidden information (metadata, attachments,
    JavaScript, links, invisible text, hidden layers, comments); rotate,
    delete, move, insert, extract, split and combine pages; AES-256
    passwords and permissions; export to PNG, JPEG, text, HTML and .docx
    (our own writer, reflowed); undo and redo. Recommends python3-pymupdf.
    Gate: test/pdf-edit-test.py (in make lint), test/pdf-test.py.

